    {"id":"s145","tr":"Lord Jesus Christ, who hast said: Ask and ye shall receive; seek and ye shall find; knock and it shall be opened unto you; mercifully grant us, we beseech Thee, the affection of Thy most divine love, that we may love Thee with our whole heart, mouth, and deed, and never cease to praise Thee.","tc":[27],"tb":"traditional-composite","g":["Lord","Jesus","Christ","who","didst say","ask","and","ye shall receive","seek","and","ye shall find","knock","and","shall be opened","unto you","we beseech","grant","to us","who ask","of most divine","Thy","of love","affection","that","Thee","whole","with the heart","with the mouth","and","in deed","may love","and","from","Thy","never","praise","may cease"]},
